The `ray()` modifier allows you to debug the current `$value` with **[myray.app](https://myray.app/)**.

```php
expect(14)->ray(); // 14
expect([1, 2])->sequence(
    fn ($number) => $number->toBe(1),
    fn ($number) => $number->ray(), // 2
);
```

